{
"name": "valve_ep2_silo2_doors",
"note": "Episode Two's flat doors over the top of Silo 2 (ep2_outland_11a, visgroup Silo_2: the silo's seal that the player shuts with a lever before the Hunters come): two leaves (models/props_silo/missile_doors.mdl, 208 along the way they slide, 330 across, 29 thick, no collision of their own) each carried by a func_movelinear (silo_seal_door and _door_2: movedistance 136 toward each other, speed 5, so 27 s; startsound ep2_outland_11.launchdoors_close_start, blockdamage 100; their brushes 320 by about 190 by 8, metalwall085a), lying flat at the silo's top in their frame (models/props_silo/missile_doors_frame.mdl, a prop_static 692 by 342, 33 deep); the loop (sound_launchdoors_loop, ep2_outland_11.launchdoors_close_loop) and two stops (sound_launchdoors_stop, _close_end), which Valve's relay plays 0.5 and 26 s after the lever. Anchor: the middle of the frame's opening at the leaves' height (1824 -11264 144 in Valve's map). The leaves start apart (Open closes them). Left out: Valve's story round it (rappelling soldiers, Magnusson's microphones, the alarm relays). The bunker's entrance (map_forest.py, BunkerForest.door): the leaves stood upright as a sliding pair, drawn at 0.654.",
